<details name="doom-help" data-doom-control-help>
  <summary>Controls</summary>
  <div class="doom-help-content space-y-3">
    <p>Keyboard: arrows move · Ctrl/J fire · Space/K use · Shift/Alt strafe · Escape menu · Enter confirm. Drag outside controls to rotate the badge. Scroll to zoom.</p>
    <p>Touch: hold the direction and action buttons to move or fire. Hold Strafe + a direction to sidestep. Use Screen for a closer view or Full to pose the whole badge.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<style>
  details { border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border) / 0.4); }
  summary { min-height: 44px; padding-block: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 0.75rem; }
  summary:hover, details[open] > summary { color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid hsl(var(--ring)); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .doom-help-content { padding-bottom: 0.75rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.75; }
</style>
